+
+Reduce synchronous cryptodev calls without waiting for future input.
+The optional NSS overlay provides the batching helper and runtime guard.
+
+Signed-off-by: coolsnowwolf <coolsnowwolf@gmail.com>
+
+--- a/tls.go
++++ b/tls.go
